  "title": "UBI 10 10.2 in rootless Podman on a GitHub-hosted ubuntu-24.04 runner",
  "description": "The ubi job of .github/workflows/compatibility.yml: UBI 10 pinned by digest, in rootless Podman as the runner's user, all capabilities dropped, no-new-privileges, unprivileged, no device; the backend lock, Django check, Django tests and pytest with uv's CPython 3.12.15, not the image's Python. Not a RHEL host: the kernel, SELinux mode and systemd are the Ubuntu VM's. Its glibc 2.39 and CPython 3.12.15 meet the checked bounds, so it copies checked.",
